+`FileSystem.supportsFileRemoval` advertises guarded single-file deletion. `removeFile(target, { version }, signal?, sandboxPolicy?)` rejects unsupported providers, stale versions and directories. Local providers serialize deletion with text writes; the sandbox provider applies current-path containment before removal.
